R-CH8 R-SC10 R-NS3 R-C7 (slice 241, Design Q616): the exact word `nightly` is `nightly@latest`, not a prefix of every nightly id (it replaces the ambiguous-prefix error of R-SC10). config.toml has a default (an installed nightly). `roc install nightly --yes` installs the newest nightly that min-release-age allows (nightly-2026-11-09-eeeeeee is 1 day old and hidden); the default stays. The expected files are the real run of the same case with `@latest` (guess, TW18).
